%!PS-Adobe-3.0 EPSF-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 120 120
%%Title: tiling pattern whose cell is painted with another pattern
%%EndComments
<< /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 4 4] /XStep 4 /YStep 4
   /PaintProc { pop 0 0 0 1 setcmykcolor 0 0 2 2 rectfill } >> matrix makepattern /Inner exch def
<< /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 2 /BBox [0 0 30 30] /XStep 30 /YStep 30
   /PaintProc { pop Inner setpattern 0 0 15 15 rectfill 1 0 0 0 setcmykcolor 15 15 15 15 rectfill } >>
matrix makepattern /Outer exch def
Outer setpattern 0 0 120 120 rectfill
showpage
%%EOF
